# CQ: What situations may result in the high-risk AI system presenting a risk within the meaning of Article 79(1)?
# Question: lexreq:aiact-art12-2-a-cq1
# Requirement: lexreq:aiact-art12-2-a
# Terms: aidoc-lex:LogEntry, aidoc-lex:loggedEventType, aidoc-lex:RiskSituation

PREFIX aidoc-lex: <https://w3id.org/aidoc-ap/lex#>
PREFIX prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?entry ?system ?time ?note WHERE {
  ?entry a aidoc-lex:LogEntry ;
         aidoc-lex:loggedEventType aidoc-lex:RiskSituation ;
         aidoc-lex:concernsSystem ?system .
  OPTIONAL { ?entry prov:generatedAtTime ?time }
  OPTIONAL { ?entry rdfs:comment ?note }
}
